OL,3,ALeasehold system set to be scrapped in
OL,4,AEngland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is to introduce new laws
OL,7,Fto scrap the ownership rules for flats
OL,8,Fin England and Wales and cap ground
OL,9,Frents at #250 a year.
OL,11,FUnder the plans, which will not become
OL,12,Flaw until at least next year, most new
OL,13,Fleasehold flats will be banned and
OL,14,Freplaced with commonhold, where
OL,15,Fresidents collectively own and manage
OL,16,Ftheir buildings.
OL,18,FHousing Minister Matthew Pennycook said
OL,19,Fthe current leasehold system was
OL,20,F"blighting lives" and was an
OL,21,F"anachronism in the 21st century".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
