OL,3,ALeasehold system set to be scrapped in
OL,4,AEngland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut freeholders, such as housing
OL,7,Fassociations and property firms, say
OL,8,Fthe plan is an "unprecedented abuse" of
OL,9,Ftheir rights, which will wipe billions
OL,10,Ffrom the value of pension funds, which
OL,11,Fhave invested heavily in property.
